      <div><p class="lp-kicker">The CallTeam buying desk / 08</p><h1>8 best <span>Nooks alternatives</span> <small>for small sales teams.</small></h1><p class="lp-intro">Does your five- or ten-person team actually need Nooks? Compare the diallers, see the costs and decide what is worth paying for.</p><div class="lp-actions"><a class="lp-button" href="#comparison">Compare the 8 alternatives ↓</a><a class="lp-text-link" href="#team-cost">See costs for your team →</a></div><p class="nk-brands">Trellus · Apollo · Close · CloudTalk · JustCall · PhoneBurner · Salesfinity · Orum</p></div>
