    <p class="lp-direct-answer"><strong>Our starting verdict:</strong> check Apollo first if you already pay for it. Compare Trellus and CloudTalk for a published-price parallel route. Consider Close when you need a CRM too. Nooks and Orum deserve a trial when their team features solve a specific problem and the complete quote fits your budget.</p>
    <p class="lp-method"><strong>Sources checked {{ guide.reviewed }}.</strong> These are CallTeam's buying recommendations, informed by B2B calling work and linked product documentation. We have not run a controlled eight-product benchmark. CallTeam uses Apollo and Close and lists both, along with Orum, as technology partners.</p>
