    <div class="nk-cost-notes"><p><strong>Apollo:</strong> $149 is the team add-on. Existing users add it to their current subscription and usage. New buyers must also price paid Apollo seats.</p><p><strong>JustCall:</strong> one caller pays for two Pro seats. <strong>Salesfinity:</strong> six or more licences need a team offer. <strong>Orum:</strong> the quoted purchase starts at nine seats.</p><p><strong>Trellus:</strong> figures use individual Power + Parallel seats; shared team features can require Business. <strong>PhoneBurner:</strong> figures use Professional for browser calling.</p></div>
    <div class="nk-example"><h3>A five-caller example.</h3><p>Five Close Growth subscriptions come to <strong>$545/month</strong> before usage. Five Trellus Power + Parallel seats come to <strong>$749.95/month</strong>, plus any CRM you keep and extra usage. Close includes the CRM; Trellus adds parallel calling to a supported setup. Compare the work each covers before treating the price gap as a saving.</p></div>
    <p class="nk-related">When comparing in-house calling with hiring help, include payroll, data, management and follow-up in the budget. Our <a href="/b2b-lead-generation-roi-calculator/">campaign ROI calculator</a> lets you work with those wider costs and your own assumptions.</p>
